OL,3,GNEWSAParking fines raise #65,000 for
OL,4,Acouncil
OL,5,
OL,6,FCar parking fines generated almost
OL,7,F#65,000 over a year for a district
OL,8,Fcouncil, a Freedom of Information
OL,9,Frequest has revealed.
OL,11,FHuntingdonshire District Council in
OL,12,FCambridgeshire received #64,718.20 in
OL,13,Frevenue from car park fines between 1
OL,14,FOctober 2025 and 30 September 2026.
OL,16,FFailing to pay, wrongly parking in a
OL,17,Fdisabled bay, and parking beyond the
OL,18,Fbay markings were the top three reasons
OL,19,Ffor fines being issued, according to
OL,20,Fthe Local Democracy Reporting Service.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
